+    # A PD prefill server never replays the target-verify graph (its pool has
+    # no spec-verify scratch); non-generation models and MindSpore have no
+    # decode graph; the backend may be disabled. Shared with the kt-kernel
+    # pre-registration in capture_cuda_graphs.
